CHECK:COMPARISON_TO_NULL: Comparison to NULL could be written "!sphy->pmureg"
#89: FILE: drivers/usb/phy/phy-samsung-usb.c:46:
+	if (sphy->pmureg == NULL) {

Comparisons to NULL in the form (foo == NULL) or (foo != NULL)
are better written as (!foo) and (foo).

